## Forensic-use disclaimer

Xabarnavis AI is a research and decision-support system. Its outputs,
scores, heatmaps, classifications, and generated reports do not constitute
conclusive proof, legal advice, or an expert forensic opinion.

Results must be independently reviewed by qualified professionals and
evaluated together with source provenance, metadata, chain-of-custody
records, contextual evidence, and applicable legal requirements.

The software must not be used as the sole basis for legal, disciplinary,
employment, financial, medical, or law-enforcement decisions.

